{"4031280":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Boku Boku","steam_appid":4031280,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4798000],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Building sandbox<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boku Boku is a Cozy Building sandbox game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build houses, create your own worlds, and make new friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wondrous world, and leave your mark in this pixel paradise.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Steam Deck support<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI tailored for a perfect experience on Steam Deck.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with а controller to make your time more comfortable.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your touchscreen to build what you like.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/extras\/1d023d28780a8b9d978e1da4b633e086.avif?t=1793721643\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/extras_big\/1d023d28780a8b9d978e1da4b633e086.webp?t=1793721643 width=1560 height=474 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------  Game Features  ----------<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌳 Build freely 🌳<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of blocks and start building. No need to gather materials.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Customize your character ✨<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique character and show off your personal style.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👫 Multiplayer mode 👫<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 16 people at the same time, with both text and voice chat supported.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩷 Relaxed gameplay - Your character can’t get hurt, so you’re to do whatever you want. Swimming, dancing, using the bathroom, you choose what do you want to do.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐱 Animals - Cats, dogs, chickens, ducks, and more. You can even ride horses, cows, and alpacas. Create your own lively farm.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Dolls (NPC) - If the world feels too lonely, you can create dolls and give them instructions to make the world more alive.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Minigames - Toys are more than decorations, you can actually play with them. See how many minigames you can discover.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎹 Musical instruments - Play instruments like pianos and trumpets, and use the melody editor to compose your own music.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Custom blocks - Use the easel and workbench to design your own blocks. You can even import PNG or JPG images from your device.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Wiring system - Connect switches and objects with wires to create simple circuits, like turning lights on and off.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 Multiple zones - Use the “Land Cube” to create different zones, then connect them with doors and a wrench so you can move between indoor and outdoor spaces<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 Exploration quests - Not sure what certain objects do? Exploration quests will guide you and help you learn how different objects can be used.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/extras\/5fcdd4a47e9f959dd771679547246b72.avif?t=1793721643\" width=1560 height=556 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------  Functional Features  ----------<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Workshop 🧩<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your creation with other players and download content made by the community. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☁️ Cloud storage ☁️<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back up your data and easily switch between multiple devices. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📺 Graphics settings 📺<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust display mode, resolution, and frame rate (FPS) for a smoother experience. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⌨️ Customizable buttons ⌨️<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both keyboard and controller buttons are customizable.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Controller support 🎮<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with your Xbox, PlayStation, Nintendo Switch Pro controller or with many other controllers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will automatically detect your controller and display the corresponding buttons for your device.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can seamlessly switch between keyboard, mouse, and controller.)<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Building sandbox<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boku Boku is a Cozy Building sandbox game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build houses, create your own worlds, and make new friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wondrous world, and leave your mark in this pixel paradise.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Steam Deck support<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI tailored for a perfect experience on Steam Deck.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with а controller to make your time more comfortable.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your touchscreen to build what you like.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/extras\/1d023d28780a8b9d978e1da4b633e086.avif?t=1793721643\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/extras_big\/1d023d28780a8b9d978e1da4b633e086.webp?t=1793721643 width=1560 height=474 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------  Game Features  ----------<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌳 Build freely 🌳<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of blocks and start building. No need to gather materials.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Customize your character ✨<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique character and show off your personal style.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👫 Multiplayer mode 👫<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 16 people at the same time, with both text and voice chat supported.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩷 Relaxed gameplay - Your character can’t get hurt, so you’re to do whatever you want. Swimming, dancing, using the bathroom, you choose what do you want to do.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐱 Animals - Cats, dogs, chickens, ducks, and more. You can even ride horses, cows, and alpacas. Create your own lively farm.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Dolls (NPC) - If the world feels too lonely, you can create dolls and give them instructions to make the world more alive.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Minigames - Toys are more than decorations, you can actually play with them. See how many minigames you can discover.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎹 Musical instruments - Play instruments like pianos and trumpets, and use the melody editor to compose your own music.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Custom blocks - Use the easel and workbench to design your own blocks. You can even import PNG or JPG images from your device.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Wiring system - Connect switches and objects with wires to create simple circuits, like turning lights on and off.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 Multiple zones - Use the “Land Cube” to create different zones, then connect them with doors and a wrench so you can move between indoor and outdoor spaces<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 Exploration quests - Not sure what certain objects do? Exploration quests will guide you and help you learn how different objects can be used.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/extras\/5fcdd4a47e9f959dd771679547246b72.avif?t=1793721643\" width=1560 height=556 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------  Functional Features  ----------<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Workshop 🧩<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your creation with other players and download content made by the community. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☁️ Cloud storage ☁️<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back up your data and easily switch between multiple devices. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📺 Graphics settings 📺<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust display mode, resolution, and frame rate (FPS) for a smoother experience. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⌨️ Customizable buttons ⌨️<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both keyboard and controller buttons are customizable.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Controller support 🎮<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with your Xbox, PlayStation, Nintendo Switch Pro controller or with many other controllers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will automatically detect your controller and display the corresponding buttons for your device.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(You can seamlessly switch between keyboard, mouse, and controller.)<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >　<\/h2>","short_description":"Boku Boku is a Cozy Building sandbox game. You can build houses, create your own worlds, and make new friends. Explore a wondrous world, and leave your mark in this pixel paradise.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Russian, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Turkish, Greek, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Thai, Ukrainian, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Romanian, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Arabic, Korean, Croatian, Icelandic, Catalan, Hindi, Kazakh, Georgian, Bangla, Nepali, Hebrew, Estonian, Latvian, Slovak, Slovenian, Persian, Urdu, Luxembourgish, Lithuanian, Uyghur, Filipino, Mongolian, Malay, Marathi, Maltese, Khmer","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/bbfda6ce4cfaeb4c62fc8b097926adb5dc2bc6f6\/header.jpg?t=1793721643","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/efe309917c0ebd551ab29885359898407642f8da\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793721643","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4031280\/efe309917c0ebd551ab29885359898407642f8da\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793721643","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 600 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/